Subject: [PATCH 62/65] style(ui): halve hidden Tab syllable spacing

---
 INSTALL-PATCH.md               | 2 +-
 Install-Binaries.ps1           | 2 +-
 REWRITE-UI.md                  | 2 +-
 WeaselUI/RewriteLayout.h       | 4 ++--
 rewrite-build.txt              | 2 +-
 rime/skins/README.md           | 2 +-
